# Toolshop QA Assessment Rules

- Use Playwright + Mocha + Mochawesome: pages/, api/, helpers/, utils/, tests/
- Keep manual + UI + API cases between 5–8 each; tag @Smoke and @Regression
- Prefer data-test locators; fallback to getByRole/getByPlaceholder
- Register users with unique emails via dataGenerator — never commit secrets
- Invoice API/UI: use TG/Hesselbury billing payload; press Confirm twice for invoice
- Do not add dependencies unless justified (mocha, mochawesome, dotenv, cross-env)
- Update ai-prompts when making significant AI-assisted decisions
- Execution reports go to Projectstructure/execution-reports/mochawesome/
